https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/68c6aa74359a70b42b7d85a330a2839e965469c2","node_id":"C_kwDOOonvB9oAKDY4YzZhYTc0MzU5YTcwYjQyYjdkODVhMzMwYTI4MzllOTY1NDY5YzI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/1cbaf235ee9eb750bc624127bc0ab16dd9d511b4","sha":"1cbaf235ee9eb750bc624127bc0ab16dd9d511b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/1cbaf235ee9eb750bc624127bc0ab16dd9d511b4"}],"sha":"68c6aa74359a70b42b7d85a330a2839e965469c2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/68c6aa74359a70b42b7d85a330a2839e965469c2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/3a9d8ccc6dc4ae59030d3d9d35bd5566685afe7e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-12-01T13:24:29Z","email":"108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-12-01T13:24:29Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feature/0.0.13 (#17)\n\nThis pull request introduces significant improvements to the onboarding\nflow and project configuration management, especially for Java/Spring\nBoot projects. It adds new IPC handlers for onboarding operations,\nimproves instance management for `OnboardingManager`, and ensures\nonboarding project data is always up-to-date and available across the\napplication lifecycle. Additionally, it includes a comprehensive release\nnote for version 0.0.12, detailing new layout configuration features and\nUI/UX enhancements.\n\n**Onboarding & IPC Handler Improvements**\n\n* Ensures a global singleton instance of `OnboardingManager` is created\nand reused across the app, preventing duplicate instances and\nguaranteeing availability for all onboarding operations.\n(`ipc-handlers.js`, `main.js`)\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5L133-R143)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-58417e0f781b6656949d37258c8b9052ed266e2eb7a5163cad7b0863e6b2916aL12-R23)\n* Adds IPC handlers for advanced onboarding operations: Maven install,\nrunning Maven tests, starting Java onboarding projects, saving/loading\nenvironment variables, and retrieving Java version from `pom.xml`,\nenabling richer backend automation and UI feedback for onboarding flows.\n(`ipc-handlers.js`)\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R220-R261)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R284-R313)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R344-R367)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R484-R501)\n* Improves the clone onboarding handler to prompt for a target directory\nif not provided, enhancing user experience and error handling.\n(`ipc-handlers.js`)\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5L151-R181)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5L164-R192)\n* Ensures onboarding project data is always loaded and sent to the UI\nfrom the splash cache, keeping onboarding project lists in sync and\navailable at startup. (`main.js`)\n\n**Project Data Synchronization**\n\n* Forces reload of project data from disk after updating a project path,\nensuring consistency and up-to-date information for all users and\nprocesses. (`main.js`)\n* Always preloads critical splash cache data (including onboarding\nprojects) at startup, guaranteeing fresh data for onboarding flows.\n(`main.js`)\n\n**Documentation & Release Notes**\n\n* Adds a detailed release note for v0.0.12, describing the new advanced\nlayout configuration system, UI/UX improvements, technical enhancements,\nand security/stability updates. (`RELEASE-NOTES-0.0.12.md`)","tree":{"sha":"54f3a9d333dda332c2cc96ac5079f92c791a490f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/54f3a9d333dda332c2cc96ac5079f92c791a490f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/3a9d8ccc6dc4ae59030d3d9d35bd5566685afe7e","verification":{"payload":"tree 54f3a9d333dda332c2cc96ac5079f92c791a490f\nparent 914f67b63360251bf5b1dbda5d2d92e26eed8755\nparent 1cbaf235ee9eb750bc624127bc0ab16dd9d511b4\nauthor Juliano Soder <108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com> 1764595469 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1764595469 +0000\n\nFeature/0.0.13 (#17)\n\nThis pull request introduces significant improvements to the onboarding\nflow and project configuration management, especially for Java/Spring\nBoot projects. It adds new IPC handlers for onboarding operations,\nimproves instance management for `OnboardingManager`, and ensures\nonboarding project data is always up-to-date and available across the\napplication lifecycle. Additionally, it includes a comprehensive release\nnote for version 0.0.12, detailing new layout configuration features and\nUI/UX enhancements.\n\n**Onboarding & IPC Handler Improvements**\n\n* Ensures a global singleton instance of `OnboardingManager` is created\nand reused across the app, preventing duplicate instances and\nguaranteeing availability for all onboarding operations.\n(`ipc-handlers.js`, `main.js`)\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5L133-R143)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-58417e0f781b6656949d37258c8b9052ed266e2eb7a5163cad7b0863e6b2916aL12-R23)\n* Adds IPC handlers for advanced onboarding operations: Maven install,\nrunning Maven tests, starting Java onboarding projects, saving/loading\nenvironment variables, and retrieving Java version from `pom.xml`,\nenabling richer backend automation and UI feedback for onboarding flows.\n(`ipc-handlers.js`)\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R220-R261)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R284-R313)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R344-R367)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5R484-R501)\n* Improves the clone onboarding handler to prompt for a target directory\nif not provided, enhancing user experience and error handling.\n(`ipc-handlers.js`)\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5L151-R181)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-b9aa81daebd218551cb96802dce9331004d5f70ea513db2a0c509fa4eb950fb5L164-R192)\n* Ensures onboarding project data is always loaded and sent to the UI\nfrom the splash cache, keeping onboarding project lists in sync and\navailable at startup. (`main.js`)\n\n**Project Data Synchronization**\n\n* Forces reload of project data from disk after updating a project path,\nensuring consistency and up-to-date information for all users and\nprocesses. (`main.js`)\n* Always preloads critical splash cache data (including onboarding\nprojects) at startup, guaranteeing fresh data for onboarding flows.\n(`main.js`)\n\n**Documentation & Release Notes**\n\n* Adds a detailed release note for v0.0.12, describing the new advanced\nlayout configuration system, UI/UX improvements, technical enhancements,\nand security/stability updates. (`RELEASE-NOTES-0.0.12.md`)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpLZcNCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAIBIQAAom9joGL5snZtOlgHNhf178\nMP+SwT+wa4xwKC9E+XrLAm+YxxP3drJkHxLpl9KSQ7acKetuWTJC4Jb06RN8tsE5\no9OyCZt7fqTXFtIfgOiODfoTL3Xrfo3crKxzwGsh6o0AfBTHJWJXnBAKfAUGY0av\nDzvALV1Q2j4++Ga4LcoyMqSIxEMIuMZ/skq4mbhslb9rmfYKsCx2TL4lv8VlNnYw\nw9NJfPQA+3wDbCxM5bSt+C7G8OoJ6Re3El4xbONmnfHDpC7cxm6o2B4E9TjM8PnZ\n9NX6IzJkDT3sa3ZP0mIBphskwyVDiAC+u8dnimccv9AFmZ4HcF7sHpdxZeARrSZC\nOYMuzceoycCtxgozhAYwNZnVggyZV/p09DSzHb/ExmY3LIpMKXSjmBv5Tv37xXtW\nto92LB+cG6BdlWylgXDAHy8ct7ZBklFz/8XlKPpUmbyVYkTGiowGcJWz/JD0upsv\nGf1xqLi1wFJr5Ov/1Lv2Nz30BiVYKieT3/QjxD14pkAIBKQvOtrBTxat0oXMTeWe\nUKl12z7g2oS1LoX9hh3yqlUKlXfQRmHx6QLszRsO+SbQ63jvQCn/qa3pUbBsJIxQ\n7+xDcs0qBxKrR2lRytx2hF0CgPy/Pajtwkk0BvNJasyQHxjyKlijAIwMEccVrTHh\nylghtdfw64XYuynIkI01\n=MgE4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-12-01T13:24:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/org