n)\n- Use port 8080 for Java backend projects\n- Detect startup success using Spring Boot patterns","tree":{"sha":"11478e390bc5a07008d399e6f9efc9c118a11852","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/11478e390bc5a07008d399e6f9efc9c118a11852"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/65aefe1f7d1353ff2b7573297a156b667fd9b858","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/65aefe1f7d1353ff2b7573297a156b667fd9b858","node_id":"C_kwDOOonvB9oAKDY1YWVmZTFmN2QxMzUzZmYyYjc1NzMyOTdhMTU2YjY2N2ZkOWI4NTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/914f67b63360251bf5b1dbda5d2d92e26eed8755","sha":"914f67b63360251bf5b1dbda5d2d92e26eed8755","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/914f67b63360251bf5b1dbda5d2d92e26eed8755"}],"sha":"65aefe1f7d1353ff2b7573297a156b667fd9b858","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/65aefe1f7d1353ff2b7573297a156b667fd9b858"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/914f67b63360251bf5b1dbda5d2d92e26eed8755/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-28T19:58:33Z","email":"108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-28T19:58:33Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feature/0.0.12 (#16)\n\nThis pull request introduces significant improvements to the Front-End\nManager application, focusing on enhanced onboarding project management,\na new advanced layout configuration system, and a robust terminal\nselection feature. The changes improve usability, reliability, and\ncustomization for users across different operating systems.\n\n### Onboarding Project Management Improvements\n\n* Implemented advanced process control for onboarding projects,\nincluding automatic restart, cancellation with anti-duplication, and\nrobust stopping by port, with async/await for reliability.\n\n### Advanced Layout and UI Enhancements\n\n* Added a dynamic layout configuration system: users can independently\nadjust card and body widths, apply presets, and preview changes\ninstantly with persistent settings. The modal interface is cleaner, and\nversioning is repositioned for better visibility.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5L1-R30)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfL196-R212)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfL572-R659)\n\n### Terminal Selection Feature\n\n* Introduced a modal for users to select their preferred terminal for\nopening projects, with real-time listing, selection, saving, and\nfeedback. The modal supports both light and dark modes and interacts\nwith backend IPC for persistence.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR519-R583)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR628-R637)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR705-R727)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR882)\n[[5]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR1332-R1452)\n\n### UI and Modal Clean-up\n\n* Hid navigation bars and unnecessary elements in modal windows for a\ncleaner, distraction-free configuration experience.\n\n### Branding and Documentation Updates\n\n* Renamed the application and updated documentation from \"Micro\nFront-End Manager\" to \"Front-End Manager\" to reflect its broader scope.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5L1-R30)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-5065e01d99c3e40a0eab0ce98b99210946ad19bb3479150f3bf47fd28037e7a5L5-R5)","tree":{"sha":"134b0e03dc9788bcac42f4fd4378dddb88500c7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/134b0e03dc9788bcac42f4fd4378dddb88500c7c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/914f67b63360251bf5b1dbda5d2d92e26eed8755","verification":{"payload":"tree 134b0e03dc9788bcac42f4fd4378dddb88500c7c\nparent acd72fec0f1cb95b03f78205656dcde3e5d35e87\nparent 25060dcbdbaf518f08975b56053b8c8293e8e340\nauthor Juliano Soder <108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com> 1764359913 +0000\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1764359913 +0000\n\nFeature/0.0.12 (#16)\n\nThis pull request introduces significant improvements to the Front-End\nManager application, focusing on enhanced onboarding project management,\na new advanced layout configuration system, and a robust terminal\nselection feature. The changes improve usability, reliability, and\ncustomization for users across different operating systems.\n\n### Onboarding Project Management Improvements\n\n* Implemented advanced process control for onboarding projects,\nincluding automatic restart, cancellation with anti-duplication, and\nrobust stopping by port, with async/await for reliability.\n\n### Advanced Layout and UI Enhancements\n\n* Added a dynamic layout configuration system: users can independently\nadjust card and body widths, apply presets, and preview changes\ninstantly with persistent settings. The modal interface is cleaner, and\nversioning is repositioned for better visibility.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5L1-R30)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfL196-R212)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfL572-R659)\n\n### Terminal Selection Feature\n\n* Introduced a modal for users to select their preferred terminal for\nopening projects, with real-time listing, selection, saving, and\nfeedback. The modal supports both light and dark modes and interacts\nwith backend IPC for persistence.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR519-R583)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR628-R637)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR705-R727)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR882)\n[[5]](diffhunk://#diff-054ac82e14a9f5381246e2fb301788f04bef74b737ba297f68a1d600f0379dbfR1332-R1452)\n\n### UI and Modal Clean-up\n\n* Hid navigation bars and unnecessary elements in modal windows for a\ncleaner, distraction-free configuration experience.\n\n### Branding and Documentation Updates\n\n* Renamed the application and updated documentation from \"Micro\nFront-End Manager\" to \"Front-End Manager\" to reflect its broader scope.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5L1-R30)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-5065e01d99c3e40a0eab0ce98b99210946ad19bb3479150f3bf47fd28037e7a5L5-R5)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJpKf7pCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAbEcQADEubv2ZGKd5PpmByNa/AuqL\n9MAWAFzR9u0SdAGvuhm/56/V4kwgAJsiKSUpWC5ZzLyATJTcpreo/2bYh4xXRe2n\n5jE4N7IIaUClJohmRrVY3XFAKVHxOx4tM5YRgTrqFoXIvCMZGICsbReLZT+Karov\nymg6IUcJkauI29AmEDuL7bhakk/xaprPyxQWFXCEMmWlblzRTv+H3v1baNxcoai2\nExFZYO5d4XNlN8RIgpsL/s1KFXd59j4eiz4PkL+2LPhsWTCrxljqjoj8L9sLpuOq\nO7cPeoAASu9KsFXWJFFT2mooCxpVXgXKAdD680rP815x8n1zTsKEIXBY0byfCvhS\nWE5WpPnKqbInD1apUOT2V4mdj1OrwmtU92Nm1O1Hh3Qv+qg1Nc+l8fWMECgk5GWN\nLzcperxvgTUeWIV3WkhtePef4H9Bhd76ZDny/OyFtNMSLhFw3AZR1zj+qBPqAkcU\nN+7oobCz4xFQXAlBbVdnNrExgAH8aRCMLQ01quF7mWIEgMTkhMJ4q/boeg+ytc7B\nEvflDXkxNh8Zxe3TwbqW1Duhn2Zf071xdwNrQ4bSsT0A/p2uPtXkIoIleZtuegAA\npWwpducp+CLZOobZUlKVjYeimH1