m/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/c6af18816c82078af640bc18e9058d1a02649481/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-06T11:48:11Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-06T11:48:11Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"message":"feat: Rebrand to \"Front-end Manager\" and version management\n\n🎯 Major Rebranding:\n- ✅ Updated app name from \"Micro Front-Ends\" to \"Front-end Manager\"\n- ✅ Reflects expanded scope: PAS + PAMP + Onboarding projects\n- ✅ Updated version to 0.0.11 across all files\n- ✅ Added dynamic version management system\n\n📋 Version Management:\n- ✅ Created getAppVersion() function reading from package.json\n- ✅ Added IPC handler ''get-app-version'' for frontend\n- ✅ Dynamic version display in main title with loadAppVersion()\n- ✅ Window title now shows version dynamically\n- ✅ Ready for future version updates (next release: 0.1.0)\n\n📁 Files Updated:\n- package.json: Version 0.0.11 + updated description\n- index.html: Title + dynamic version display\n- main.js: Window title + version management system\n- configs.html: Updated titles and version\n- splash.html: Updated branding and subtitle\n- new-clis.html: Updated help text\n\n🚀 User Impact:\n- Clear app identity reflecting 3 project types support\n- Visible version information for better support\n- Consistent branding across all windows\n- Future-proof version management\n\n💡 Technical Features:\n- Dynamic version loading from package.json\n- Automatic UI updates when version changes\n- Fallback version handling\n- Cross-window consistency","tree":{"sha":"0ca84a36325835d7900005274e732d20d429e12e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/0ca84a36325835d7900005274e732d20d429e12e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/c6af18816c82078af640bc18e9058d1a02649481","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/c6af18816c82078af640bc18e9058d1a02649481","node_id":"C_kwDOOonvB9oAKGM2YWYxODgxNmM4MjA3OGFmNjQwYmMxOGU5MDU4ZDFhMDI2NDk0ODE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/b9fef1d9ebf7edf4c4b0ead54c35e9e3262cb88d","sha":"b9fef1d9ebf7edf4c4b0ead54c35e9e3262cb88d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/b9fef1d9ebf7edf4c4b0ead54c35e9e3262cb88d"}],"sha":"c6af18816c82078af640bc18e9058d1a02649481","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/c6af18816c82078af640bc18e9058d1a02649481"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/b9fef1d9ebf7edf4c4b0ead54c35e9e3262cb88d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-06T11:43:09Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-06T11:43:09Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"message":"feat: Complete onboarding system with move/delete/terminal functionality\n\n🎯 Main Achievements:\n- ✅ Refactored main.js (6958→6578 lines) extracting splash screen to splash-manager.js\n- ✅ Fixed critical onboarding UI bugs (button visibility, logging, auto-save)\n- ✅ Implemented complete Move/Delete functionality for onboarding projects\n- ✅ Added Terminal button functionality for onboarding projects\n\n📁 Files Added:\n- splash-manager.js: Modular splash screen management (400+ lines)\n- onboarding-node-config.html: React-only Node.js config interface with auto-save\n\n🔧 Enhanced Files:\n- main.js: Reduced complexity, added openOnboardingNodeConfigWindow()\n- index.html: Fixed updateOnboardingProjectUI() bug, added move/delete/terminal event listeners\n- ipc-handlers.js: Added move-onboarding-project and delete-onboarding-project handlers\n- onboarding-manager.js: Enhanced with detailed logging and version persistence\n\n🚀 New Features:\n- Move onboarding projects between folders (with confirmation dialogs)\n- Delete onboarding projects (with confirmation)\n- Open terminal in project folder\n- Auto-save Node.js version selection\n- Detailed command logging with frontend output\n- Complete PAS-style button management for onboarding\n\n🐛 Bugs Fixed:\n- Critical button visibility bug in updateOnboardingProjectUI()\n- Move/Delete buttons now work exactly like PAS system\n- Command logging now visible in frontend\n- Auto-save eliminates manual save button\n\n💡 Technical Details:\n- Reused existing PAS move/delete patterns for consistency\n- Added comprehensive error handling and progress logging\n- Cross-platform terminal support (Windows/macOS/Linux)\n- Proper IPC communication with detailed debugging","tree":{"sha":"2997ed0b4b5863735ddaaae070b1ad1030f7f49d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/2997ed0b4b5863735ddaaae070b1ad1030f7f49d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/b9fef1d9ebf7edf4c4b0ead54c35e9e3262cb88d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder