"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/1ba17b98c9469f36138a529b63de86a1a955328e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-03T11:56:16Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-03T11:56:16Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"message":"🐛 Correção Crítica: Comando PAMP de ''npm run serve'' → ''npm start''\n\n🔧 Problema Identificado:\n- Projetos PAMP falhando com \"Missing script: serve\"\n- Comando alterado incorretamente da v0.0.8 para v0.0.9.x\n- Erro afetando todos os projetos mp-pamp-*\n\n✅ Correção Aplicada:\n- Revertido comando PAMP de ''npm run serve'' para ''npm start''\n- Corrigidos ambos os locais no código (linha 4584 e 4636)\n- Projetos PAMP agora funcionam corretamente\n\n📋 Locais Corrigidos:\n- main.js linha ~4584: npm start (comando global)\n- main.js linha ~4636: npmCmd start (comando com Node.js portátil)\n\n🎯 Projetos Afetados:\n- mp-pamp (principal)\n- mp-pamp-setup\n- mp-pamp-comercial\n- mp-pamp-vendas\n- mp-pamp-catalogo\n- mp-pamp-marketplace\n\n✅ Resultado: Projetos PAMP voltam a funcionar normalmente","tree":{"sha":"103998fb02e6dcf3df0a1bfb89de34cbf38e9de4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/103998fb02e6dcf3df0a1bfb89de34cbf38e9de4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/1b