der/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/4443cb21ed1cdcde5f75f1154d8970f76fbbe669/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-10-20T23:57:10Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-10-20T23:57:10Z","email":"juliano.soder@viavarejo.com.br","name":"Juliano Soder"},"message":"feat: melhorias UI e tratamento de warnings\n\n- Corrigido tratamento de warnings npm como erros críticos\n  * Backend: ignora linhas curtas do stderr (ex: \"npm\" isolado)\n  * Backend: isActualError() detecta warnings primeiro\n  * Frontend: isWarning verifica antes de classificar como erro\n  * Warnings aparecem sem ícone ❌ [ERRO]\n\n- Ajuste de cores dos botões para visual mais profissional\n  * \"Mover para...\": #007acc → #5a6c7d (azul acinzentado)\n  * \"Deletar\": red → #8b5a5a (marrom avermelhado suave)\n\n- Debug logs adicionados para troubleshooting\n  * Console mostra classificação de mensagens\n  * Logs indicam quando error=true é recebido","tree":{"sha":"a93d61a2eeee2ddb69f16b181ca2790faa877fb8","url":"https://api.git