er/commits/31cbf0856f26deaeef4a2c00128c4b4c96f32f81"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/70ab4a7af5e9d21b9d1ee581610ca70de6b892dc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-08T14:00:24Z","email":"108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-08T14:00:24Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feature/0.0.6 (#3)\n\nThis pull request introduces dark mode support and improves the user\nexperience for managing projects in the application. The main changes\ninclude the addition of a new configuration page (`configs.html`) for\ntoggling dark mode, UI/UX enhancements for project cards, and new\nfunctionality such as canceling project startup and opening a terminal\nin the project directory.\n\n**Dark Mode Support and Configuration:**\n\n* Added a new `configs.html` page with a user interface for toggling\ndark mode, including Electron IPC integration to persist and synchronize\nthe setting across windows.\n* Implemented dark mode styles throughout `index.html`, including\nbackground, text, and component-specific adjustments. The main window\nnow loads and applies dark mode based on saved configuration and listens\nfor changes from the config window.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R18-R24)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R35-R39)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R82-R88)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R162-R182)\n[[5]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R236-R254)\n\n**Project Card Enhancements:**\n\n* Added a terminal button to each project card, enabling users to open a\nterminal in the project''s directory. The button is temporarily disabled\nafter use to prevent multiple triggers.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L209-R278)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L420-R529)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R542-R544)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R575-R614)\n* Introduced a \"Cancel\" button for project startup, allowing users to\nabort the initialization process and restoring the UI state accordingly.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L209-R278)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R291-R293)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L420-R529)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R542-R544)\n[[5]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R575-R614)\n\n**State Management Improvements:**\n\n* Updated event handlers and UI logic to correctly show/hide and\nenable/disable the new terminal and cancel buttons based on project\nstate, including handling for both standard and PAMP projects.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R690)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R705)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R725)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R751)\n\nThese changes collectively enhance the application''s usability, visual\nappeal, and responsiveness to user actions, especially for users\nmanaging multiple projects and preferences.","tree":{"sha":"da3e0b5baff73018fb5b37adb720a75ac1142304","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/da3e0b5baff73018fb5b37adb720a75ac1142304"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/70ab4a7af5e9d21b9d1ee581610ca70de6b892dc","verification":{"payload":"tree da3e0b5baff73018fb5b37adb720a75ac1142304\nparent fe5f4c3b33fb28a593781d6aecbb76457b4fc2d9\nparent 41d3f7ac2ace6901d12cf0f29f1ebc94a5d6e028\nauthor Juliano Soder <108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com> 1754661624 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1754661624 -0300\n\nFeature/0.0.6 (#3)\n\nThis pull request introduces dark mode support and improves the user\nexperience for managing projects in the application. The main changes\ninclude the addition of a new configuration page (`configs.html`) for\ntoggling dark mode, UI/UX enhancements for project cards, and new\nfunctionality such as canceling project startup and opening a terminal\nin the project directory.\n\n**Dark Mode Support and Configuration:**\n\n* Added a new `configs.html` page with a user interface for toggling\ndark mode, including Electron IPC integration to persist and synchronize\nthe setting across windows.\n* Implemented dark mode styles throughout `index.html`, including\nbackground, text, and component-specific adjustments. The main window\nnow loads and applies dark mode based on saved configuration and listens\nfor changes from the config window.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R18-R24)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R35-R39)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R82-R88)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R162-R182)\n[[5]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R236-R254)\n\n**Project Card Enhancements:**\n\n* Added a terminal button to each project card, enabling users to open a\nterminal in the project''s directory. The button is temporarily disabled\nafter use to prevent multiple triggers.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L209-R278)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L420-R529)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R542-R544)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R575-R614)\n* Introduced a \"Cancel\" button for project startup, allowing users to\nabort the initialization process and restoring the UI state accordingly.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L209-R278)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R291-R293)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L420-R529)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R542-R544)\n[[5]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R575-R614)\n\n**State Management Improvements:**\n\n* Updated event handlers and UI logic to correctly show/hide and\nenable/disable the new terminal and cancel buttons based on project\nstate, including handling for both standard and PAMP projects.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R690)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R705)\n[[3]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R725)\n[[4]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R751)\n\nThese changes collectively enhance the application''s usability, visual\nappeal, and responsiveness to user actions, especially for users\nmanaging multiple projects and preferences.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJolgL5CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADngQAJw7iJSbz0PLuEfj8WOuAbGl\n62+/3rf9i4twi+rGd5NOfYWcJ54XX00gynLWhpKy1/udi61pXjcIzXQz0QBkKjVd\nEsmo/3kRLlgEPhkskMzXvadWJYOQfwTMyVkscRZGeOGh1cnFUhsCXkCCb1zzICbW\nTsPSpwvNxlEq2hNHnkvpagDE8ToUFfkvLfC+rrY0uyhckfWb0fQK6g3K9b/JZbW2\nqgvqOpk0WExn4he/ZWHb3gOTr0GN8r1FjFaLONJHeqoYUUyRQ7DmScdB+8GJW9uM\n84BNwHJHzvu8muoxlFENA+y32Haje9xipWjWkmg/2CPdZwcNg0Gqf9Rfg/hsFhmJ\n0ma+6vUHD/2zL8Dp8TJJw9z4G9mFdlIZLOqCdPlBUsSb3NgF/wjIEcnztEfOL+26\nEZEJ/LonsUxSMDJMiKuJZX+i64FBGUfgAap/f8TaPOZRQ6w30I8CPpt6d74/Bare\nYjBA56IWUsVEXWSQzRBhyRQ+QSVBft5RApYYLvMZASB5ARm6f2a7ni3YZlA6J+XM\nOwmlji03N3Gbgq7zxu8qnUhQt8sPhT38Cx3RamkelR+K7JI+QdaMfztUS6lHTc2U\n7/khxHr0m5XtKIOt9CU5kdk9Tcz2z6IxC2Q8KzlJLpoh5QTLmulPFspPJSQLALsI\nHy8QDC39QiAZhdkPPX1y\n=W8ia\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-08-08T14:00:25Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://a