ects and ensuring better handling of project-specific actions. The\nchanges include the addition of a folder icon for inputs, updates to\nevent listeners for project actions, and improved error handling and\nlogging.\n\n### UI Enhancements:\n* Added a folder icon (`.folder-icon`) to project input fields for\nbrowsing project directories. The icon includes hover effects, a\ndisabled state, and adjusted input padding to accommodate the icon.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R102-R153)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L345-R424)`)\n* Updated project cards to include the folder icon and adjusted styles\nfor better alignment and usability.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R203-L178)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L345-R424)`)\n\n### Event Handling Updates:\n* Added click event listeners to the folder icons to trigger a\n`browse-project-folder` event via `ipcRenderer`.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R341-R348)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R455-R466)`)\n* Ensured folder icons are disabled during actions like downloading,\nstarting, or deleting a project to prevent unintended interactions.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R372-R380)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R568-R576)`)\n\n### Logging and Error Handling Improvements:\n* Improved logging for project-specific actions, ensuring messages are\ndisplayed only for the relevant project and avoiding duplicate log\nentries.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R203-L178)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L614-R769)`)\n* Enhanced error handling for project deletion, re-enabling the delete\nbutton and folder icon in case of errors.\n(`[index.htmlL614-R769](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L614-R769)`)\n\n### Code Refactoring:\n* Consolidated global listeners for project status updates and deletion\nlogs to reduce duplication and improve maintainability.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R539-R554)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R597-R672)`)\n\n### Miscellaneous:\n* Updated project path synchronization logic to ensure the correct index\nis used for both PAMP and PAS projects.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L198-R280)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L579-L587)`)","tree":{"sha":"776300232eb9a0035f99fd8162a9c1abfa7f1cf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/776300232eb9a0035f99fd8162a9c1abfa7f1cf0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/b4b9bfbec8f446567fb20f79e797afe6b6db322c","verification":{"payload":"tree 776300232eb9a0035f99fd8162a9c1abfa7f1cf0\nparent b7319747c2e8619778d48f0a198cc9949278560a\nparent 29e98fa8b23c861456f9bc30d3d1d3aa79c55803\nauthor Juliano Soder <108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com> 1753791579 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1753791579 -0300\n\nfix(index): Fix de bug conhecidos com instalação de dependências e colocado opção de reiniciar projeto entre outras melhorias (#2)\n\nThis pull request introduces several enhancements and fixes to the\n`index.html` file, focusing on improving the user interface for managing\nprojects and ensuring better handling of project-specific actions. The\nchanges include the addition of a folder icon for inputs, updates to\nevent listeners for project actions, and improved error handling and\nlogging.\n\n### UI Enhancements:\n* Added a folder icon (`.folder-icon`) to project input fields for\nbrowsing project directories. The icon includes hover effects, a\ndisabled state, and adjusted input padding to accommodate the icon.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R102-R153)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L345-R424)`)\n* Updated project cards to include the folder icon and adjusted styles\nfor better alignment and usability.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R203-L178)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L345-R424)`)\n\n### Event Handling Updates:\n* Added click event listeners to the folder icons to trigger a\n`browse-project-folder` event via `ipcRenderer`.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R341-R348)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R455-R466)`)\n* Ensured folder icons are disabled during actions like downloading,\nstarting, or deleting a project to prevent unintended interactions.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R372-R380)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R568-R576)`)\n\n### Logging and Error Handling Improvements:\n* Improved logging for project-specific actions, ensuring messages are\ndisplayed only for the relevant project and avoiding duplicate log\nentries.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R203-L178)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L614-R769)`)\n* Enhanced error handling for project deletion, re-enabling the delete\nbutton and folder icon in case of errors.\n(`[index.htmlL614-R769](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L614-R769)`)\n\n### Code Refactoring:\n* Consolidated global listeners for project status updates and deletion\nlogs to reduce duplication and improve maintainability.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R539-R554)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051R597-R672)`)\n\n### Miscellaneous:\n* Updated project path synchronization logic to ensure the correct index\nis used for both PAMP and PAS projects.\n(`[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L198-R280)`,\n`[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-0eb547304658805aad788d320f10bf1f292797b5e6d745a3bf617584da017051L579-L587)`)","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJoiLxbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA20EQAG74gCdU8Xm8xc2ejVQoeEXM\nHv/reR2Eaufhd/XedcC2Ro3abXG/XBxVEtToCbBjETEfUCMP5urVhOArOHL4Ofuw\n1SUp5x9xBvd4In8ZT3yqL+bOfgHBs6hlU39p9ODTQyy7TYXFSEXEZjLEoWEECf05\nTWtFFIE2p9meiW2QrHhLedgqfLzh4ORz1R1zmG0MPDBpyjI8P8DmO6HICJoc76/O\ndmne9yLdek0Vs22HLOkYamvVMTnQSbeHVNppOkTcJGIgnWRETrt8yUk1DN88XlYa\nUMDn3ArCrqGESf1WCLw15RuChJV/c14xgTs3+zImrWxOltlunoKdWj1xnYxTK5Rq\nYiMRZwUnGHnW/pXv9Cu3fmqWliuUsy2qKhv0FkshXFpmFRPlHr+JCN2POKkwou3m\nYUNdvq2cgyVBz4bBxRn/Z97jAxonSzmm6VlthBrxUEJ7FGS7xF5yY3RmWYfoA+nW\nsEEJlQE+DUccMAZIqyKz0EPMT140oOFL5AdHae4hgLWyUQEUJw25q5z4tbkYkwEl\ntohC0Nblfit8TFILv3PStJhGSsXJa83PCKy5nWE8Gr697YuEM8WkUvmi5I+5uhul\nThTkLAtHOiz34E8hxj2IGEyo79zecIe7zxGXegy6wWi2WHBdTXC4MNSAg9i8gRb2\n4Wr27ZaDAL2qxzJVvtkx\n=oNCB\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2025-07-29T12:19:39Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com