e":{"sha":"bf3e7a5c5dbfe3487bb28b15c032f6f8b813598c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/bf3e7a5c5dbfe3487bb28b15c032f6f8b813598c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/d239706209ab3b0b566a1b1336ff4903d17b65f1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/d239706209ab3b0b566a1b1336ff4903d17b65f1","node_id":"C_kwDOOonvB9oAKGQyMzk3MDYyMDlhYjNiMGI1NjZhMWIxMzM2ZmY0OTAzZDE3YjY1ZjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commit/e84f4bb11f9bc3d98841b5e1651fe626d003c123","sha":"e84f4bb11f9bc3d98841b5e1651fe626d003c123","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/e84f4bb11f9bc3d98841b5e1651fe626d003c123"}],"sha":"d239706209ab3b0b566a1b1336ff4903d17b65f1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/d239706209ab3b0b566a1b1336ff4903d17b65f1"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/108891114?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Juliano-Soder","id":108891114,"login":"Juliano-Soder","node_id":"U_kgDOBn2L6g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Juliano-Soder","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/commits/b7319747c2e8619778d48f0a198cc9949278560a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-25T15:10:49Z","email":"108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Juliano Soder"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-25T15:10:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Feature/multi plataform build (#1)\n\nThis pull request introduces a comprehensive multi-platform build system\nfor the **Micro Front-End Manager**, enabling automated builds for\nWindows and Linux with enhanced features like certificate regeneration,\nDocker-based Linux builds, and detailed documentation. The most\nimportant changes include the addition of GitHub Actions workflows, new\nbuild scripts, updates to documentation, and an automated certificate\nhandling system.\n\n### Build Automation and Workflow Enhancements:\n*\n[`.github/workflows/build.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-5c3fa597431eda03ac3339ae6bf7f05e1a50d6fc7333679ec38e21b337cb6721R1-R79):\nAdded a GitHub Actions workflow to automate multi-platform builds\n(Windows, Linux, macOS) and release creation upon tagging.\n* `build-local.ps1` and `build-local.bat`: Introduced PowerShell and\nBatch scripts for local multi-platform builds, supporting Docker and WSL\nfor Linux builds.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-5867511667a9b26799dba388f6e40daec01b215c6c40ea64e4b77326a37c09e8R1-R100)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-a4518c2b5935d241bbdb1315820a7d6c029cbf8c7a2a4f3e464331ea65a0fce6R1-R41)\n\n### Certificate Management:\n*\n[`CERTIFICADOS.md`](diffhunk://#diff-daf1d91760dde3aff5e6cb1946fb9cb7612bc25e85181d191e829489e8f27defR1-R141):\nDocumented the new automatic certificate regeneration system, ensuring\nsigned and trusted Windows builds.\n* `build-win-fresh-cert.js` (referenced in documentation): Implements\ncertificate regeneration and signing for Windows builds.\n\n### Documentation Updates:\n*\n[`BUILD.md`](diffhunk://#diff-40f60e1037245d7b8a98a7325d53890a717da9979adeb54a61a795c4ba07f9c9R1-R163):\nAdded a detailed guide for local multi-platform builds, including\nprerequisites, platform-specific instructions, and troubleshooting.\n*\n[`README.md`](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5R61-R219):\nUpdated with new build scripts, system capabilities, and instructions\nfor multi-platform builds.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5R61-R219)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5L82-R271)\n*\n[`COMO-COMPILAR.md`](diffhunk://#diff-96b3e9b0e2ba06b62b981d702c265a01643825395f774caeb1e8584aabaf1ea7R1-R47):\nSimplified instructions for quick builds, highlighting automated\noptions.\n\n### Status Tracking:\n*\n[`STATUS-FINAL.md`](diffhunk://#diff-328250248bd9a0e91a9b33ca9d72b201900a1f1328ddd8dd0ad471f583f931c1R1-R101):\nSummarized the implementation status, highlighting the successful\nconfiguration of the multi-platform build system and its key features.\n\nThese changes streamline the build and release process, making it easier\nto generate installers for multiple platforms while ensuring secure and\nconsistent builds.","tree":{"sha":"a72ba76fe3cab1ce5df97e5a363879c0b75f61c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/trees/a72ba76fe3cab1ce5df97e5a363879c0b75f61c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Juliano-Soder/Micro-Front-End-Manager/git/commits/b7319747c2e8619778d48f0a198cc9949278560a","verification":{"payload":"tree a72ba76fe3cab1ce5df97e5a363879c0b75f61c9\nparent a06c5981d5478a72fe66f78ead22056ad2b5ed9c\nparent e84f4bb11f9bc3d98841b5e1651fe626d003c123\nauthor Juliano Soder <108891114+Juliano-Soder@users.noreply.github.com> 1753456249 -0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1753456249 -0300\n\nFeature/multi plataform build (#1)\n\nThis pull request introduces a comprehensive multi-platform build system\nfor the **Micro Front-End Manager**, enabling automated builds for\nWindows and Linux with enhanced features like certificate regeneration,\nDocker-based Linux builds, and detailed documentation. The most\nimportant changes include the addition of GitHub Actions workflows, new\nbuild scripts, updates to documentation, and an automated certificate\nhandling system.\n\n### Build Automation and Workflow Enhancements:\n*\n[`.github/workflows/build.yml`](diffhunk://#diff-5c3fa597431eda03ac3339ae6bf7f05e1a50d6fc7333679ec38e21b337cb6721R1-R79):\nAdded a GitHub Actions workflow to automate multi-platform builds\n(Windows, Linux, macOS) and release creation upon tagging.\n* `build-local.ps1` and `build-local.bat`: Introduced PowerShell and\nBatch scripts for local multi-platform builds, supporting Docker and WSL\nfor Linux builds.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-5867511667a9b26799dba388f6e40daec01b215c6c40ea64e4b77326a37c09e8R1-R100)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-a4518c2b5935d241bbdb1315820a7d6c029cbf8c7a2a4f3e464331ea65a0fce6R1-R41)\n\n### Certificate Management:\n*\n[`CERTIFICADOS.md`](diffhunk://#diff-daf1d91760dde3aff5e6cb1946fb9cb7612bc25e85181d191e829489e8f27defR1-R141):\nDocumented the new automatic certificate regeneration system, ensuring\nsigned and trusted Windows builds.\n* `build-win-fresh-cert.js` (referenced in documentation): Implements\ncertificate regeneration and signing for Windows builds.\n\n### Documentation Updates:\n*\n[`BUILD.md`](diffhunk://#diff-40f60e1037245d7b8a98a7325d53890a717da9979adeb54a61a795c4ba07f9c9R1-R163):\nAdded a detailed guide for local multi-platform builds, including\nprerequisites, platform-specific instructions, and troubleshooting.\n*\n[`README.md`](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5R61-R219):\nUpdated with new build scripts, system capabilities, and instructions\nfor multi-platform builds.\n[[1]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5R61-R219)\n[[2]](diffhunk://#diff-b335630551682c19a781afebcf4d07bf978fb1f8ac04c6bf87428ed5106870f5L82-R271)\n*\n[`COMO-COMPILAR.md`](diffhunk://#diff-96b3e9b0e2ba06b62b981d702c265a01643825395f774caeb1e8584aabaf1ea7R1-R47):\nSimplified instructions for quick builds, highlighting automated\noptions.\n\n### Status Tracking:\n*\n[`STATUS-FINAL.md`](diffhunk://#diff-328250248bd9a0e91a9b33ca9d72b201900a1f1328ddd8dd0ad471f583f931c1R1-R101):\nSummarized the implementation status, highlighting the successful\nconfiguration of the multi-platform build system and its key features.\n\nThese changes streamline the build and release process, making it easier\nto generate installers for multiple platforms while ensuring secure and\nconsistent builds.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJog555CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA77EQAASLEwdhFiWXltGfCImLtpX5\nJYIl9EWYUzczaCtRmkJNSydsWBAjgVcovSkcZuTTO3Y8qdRY9rajDZmb9rb68zXa\nzTKD4O1IJ