r":{"date":"2025-05-13T10:35:06Z","email":"fkhan@fortecmedical.com","name":"fkhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-13T10:35:06Z","email":"fkhan@fortecmedical.com","name":"fkhan"},"message":"Add GitHub Actions workflow for container deployment and enhance Webpack configuration\n\n- Introduced a GitHub Actions workflow to automate deployment of the container package to AWS S3 on pushes to the master branch.\n- Added a build script to the container and marketing package.json files for production builds.\n- Updated Webpack configuration to include HtmlWebpackPlugin for generating HTML files in both container and marketing packages.\n- Created a new Webpack production configuration for the container package to support Module Federation.","tree":{"sha":"d405eb4613428ec80f682651b64031c3ca0ee75e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/git/trees/d405eb4613428ec80f682651b64031c3ca0ee75e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/git/commits/c27a6a9331bd9e9801de631791977573801b6571","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/1123faisal/mf-app/commit/c27a6a9331bd9e9801de631791977573801b6571","node_id":"C_kwDOOpJ4rtoAKGMyN2E2YTkzMzFiZDllOTgwMWRlNjMxNzkxOTc3NTczODAxYjY1NzE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/1123faisal/mf-app/commit/e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138","sha":"e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/commits/e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138"}],"sha":"c27a6a9331bd9e9801de631791977573801b6571","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/commits/c27a6a9331bd9e9801de631791977573801b6571"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/commits/e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-13T08:48:11Z","email":"fkhan@fortecmedical.com","name":"fkhan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-13T08:48:11Z","email":"fkhan@fortecmedical.com","name":"fkhan"},"message":"Add initial setup for microfrontend architecture with container, marketing, and dashboard packages\n\n- Created .gitignore to exclude node_modules and dist directories.\n- Added package.json and package-lock.json for auth, container, dashboard, and marketing packages with necessary dependencies and scripts.\n- Implemented Webpack configuration for development and production in container and marketing packages.\n- Developed basic React components for container and marketing applications, including routing and landing/pricing pages.\n- Set up HTML templates for container and marketing applications.\n- Established a microfrontend architecture using Module Federation for shared components between applications.","tree":{"sha":"63ebb72efd4d1ae9ade5b7c6cc01758f3d4ed552","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/git/trees/63ebb72efd4d1ae9ade5b7c6cc01758f3d4ed552"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/git/commits/e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/1123faisal/mf-app/commit/e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138","node_id":"C_kwDOOpJ4rtoAKGUwODNiZjQ3YWE3YjQ2YjNhZjE5MjA4ZGVhMGI2NzJlOTgyMDMxMzg","parents":[],"sha":"e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/commits/e083bf47aa7b46b3af19208dea0b672e98203138"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/1123faisal/mf-app/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=001460ecb33700cbe4edf9504232edb1f9ddcf45&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A06%3A19.943Z"}');
