o/commits/c00d87c650d3b14fc8ae385c9428f2943cb423cf"}],"sha":"b5d6015a9653313e7cdd1e602682bf6eb2d90134","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chdelucia/hunt-the-bishomalo/commits/b5d6015a9653313e7cdd1e602682bf6eb2d90134"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/google-labs-jules","id":161369871,"login":"google-labs-jules[bot]","node_id":"BOT_kgDOCZ5PDw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","type":"Bot","url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chdelucia/hunt-the-bishomalo/commits/c00d87c650d3b14fc8ae385c9428f2943cb423cf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-14T18:00:02Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-14T18:00:02Z","email":"161369871+google-labs-jules[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","name":"google-labs-jules[bot]"},"message":"⚡ Bolt: generic engine and performance optimizations\n\nThis commit transforms the Hunt the Bishomalo engine into a rules-agnostic movement and board management system, while eliminating all artificial performance bottlenecks.\n\n### 💡 What\n- Introduced `IGameRules` interface and `GAME_RULES_TOKEN` to decouple game-specific logic (Bishomalo/Wumpus) from the core `GameEngineService`.\n- Generalized UI and service methods from specific terms like `shootArrow` to generic actions like `performAction`.\n- Removed all artificial delays: typewriter effects, auto-dismissing toasts (replaced with manual close), RxJS `timer` delays, and `requestAnimationFrame` overhead in visual directives.\n- Optimized `localStorage` I/O by batching state updates during board initialization.\n\n### 🎯 Why\n- To support different games sharing the same board system and movement mechanics.\n- To fulfill the mandate for zero artificial latency and maximum application agility.\n\n### 📊 Impact\n- The core engine can now be reused by providing a different implementation of `IGameRules`.\n- Visual transitions and game state changes are now instantaneous.\n- Reduced DOM churn and storage overhead.\n\n### 🧪 Measurement\n- Verified via Playwright screenshots that transitions are immediate.\n- Confirmed persistent toasts require user interaction for dismissal.\n- Full workspace test and lint pass.\n\nCo-authored-by: chdelucia <7280443+chdelucia@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"92e32d474195cfeea6e80ada1c88692d603912ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chdelucia/hunt-the-bishomalo/git/trees/92e32d474195cfeea6e80ada1c88692d603912ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/chdelucia/hunt-the-bishomalo/git/commits/c00d87c650d3b14fc8ae385c9428f2943cb423cf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/842251?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/google-labs-jules%5Bbo