ths configuration\n\nThe build process now properly installs dependencies in each workspace\nand TypeScript project references work correctly across the monorepo.","tree":{"sha":"c8ee4068bbda1412425f4f3124d00731c17a5f1d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/trees/c8ee4068bbda1412425f4f3124d00731c17a5f1d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/commits/a63bce74ae6b87d18222e00354986ac819c03197","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/a63bce74ae6b87d18222e00354986ac819c03197","node_id":"C_kwDOOpaKl9oAKGE2M2JjZTc0YWU2Yjg3ZDE4MjIyZTAwMzU0OTg2YWM4MTljMDMxOTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/9755841c30eeb66a425af4cf96d8f6e2b1680699","sha":"9755841c30eeb66a425af4cf96d8f6e2b1680699","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/9755841c30eeb66a425af4cf96d8f6e2b1680699"}],"sha":"a63bce74ae6b87d18222e00354986ac819c03197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/a63bce74ae6b87d18222e00354986ac819c03197"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/9755841c30eeb66a425af4cf96d8f6e2b1680699/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-25T01:12:40Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-25T01:12:40Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"message":"Fix Netlify build and TypeScript project references configuration\n\nBuild Configuration Fixes:\n- Update netlify.toml to install dependencies before building in each directory\n- Fix build command to run ''npm install'' in both ui and netlify/functions\n- Move Vite to dependencies in ui/package.json for Netlify build availability\n- Remove Commerce Layer SDK dependency that was unused\n\nTypeScript Configuration Fixes:\n- Add composite: true to ui/tsconfig.json for project references\n- Add composite: true to netlify/functions/tsconfig.json for project references\n- Add emitDeclarationOnly: true to prevent full JS emit (let bundlers handle JS)\n- Change noEmit: false in ui config to allow declaration file generation\n- Add files: [] to root tsconfig.json to make it a pure solution file\n- Fix path resolution issues in root tsconfig paths configuration\n\nProject Structure Improvements:\n- Properly configure TypeScript project references for monorepo\n- Enable cross-project type checking and imports\n- Maintain separate build processes for UI (Vite) and functions (esbuild)\n- Ensure declaration files are generated for proper type resolution\n\nThe build process now properly installs dependencies in each workspace\nand TypeScript project references work correctly across the monorepo.","tree":{"sha":"15b02134c62e04db9f31611331d7957c9d8c1855","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/trees/15b02134c62e04db9f31611331d7957c9d8c1855"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/commits/9755841c30eeb66a425af4cf96d8f6e2b1680699","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subsc