,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/26ce793720f2e87d10d6142cdd5d3878e9cbbbb9","node_id":"C_kwDOOpaKl9oAKDI2Y2U3OTM3MjBmMmU4N2QxMGQ2MTQyY2RkNWQzODc4ZTljYmJiYjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43","sha":"348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43"}],"sha":"26ce793720f2e87d10d6142cdd5d3878e9cbbbb9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/26ce793720f2e87d10d6142cdd5d3878e9cbbbb9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-25T00:45:56Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-25T00:45:56Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"message":"Enhance UI components with improved styling and dry humor\n\nVisual Improvements:\n- Fix Categories component dark mode button styling and replace Unsplash images with local assets\n- Replace TriHero background image with local migrated asset and add error handling\n- Completely redesign ShippingInfo component with better typography, dark mode support, and icons\n- Improve SimpleFooter layout, readability, and dark mode compatibility\n\nDark Mode Fixes:\n- Replace hardcoded white backgrounds with design system color tokens\n- Fix text contrast issues in dark mode across all components\n- Use proper bg-card, text-foreground, and border-border classes for theme compatibility\n- Ensure all components work seamlessly in both light and dark themes\n\nContent & Humor Updates:\n- Add extensive dry humor to shipping options with ironic delivery descriptions\n- Update footer with humorous section titles and product descriptions\n- Enhance shipping policy text with witty, self-aware messaging\n- Maintain professional appearance while adding entertaining copy\n\nTechnical Enhancements:\n- Add dynamic product detail route (/products/:productCode) to fix navigation\n- Implement flexible shipping option humor mapping with fallback content\n- Add proper error handling for image loading with fallback assets\n- Improve responsive layouts and typography across components\n- Add Lucide React icons for better visual hierarchy\n\nFiles Modified:\n- Categories.tsx: Dark mode fixes and local image assets\n- TriHero.tsx: Local background image with error handling\n- ShippingInfo.tsx: Complete redesign with humor and better UX\n- SimpleFooter.tsx: Improved layout, dark mode, and funny content\n- user-routes.tsx: Added dynamic product detail route\n\nThe site now has consistent dark mode support, better typography,\nlocal asset usage, and maintains humor while being fully functional.","tree":{"sha":"cd48025fa34fe3c130535f1209dcb5949cfe9bdc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/trees/cd48025fa34fe3c130535f1209dcb5949cfe9bdc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/commits/348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43","node_id":"C_kwDOOpaKl9oAKDM0ODc4NGUwNzkyMDRmNDQxY2IxMDk1MWZlMjdlMmZkYTA4MjVhNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d","sha":"dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d"}],"sha":"348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/348784e079204f441cb10951fe27e2fda0825a43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-25T00:05:08Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-25T00:05:08Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"message":"Fix Commerce Layer market switching and authentication\n\nMajor Fixes:\n- Fix Commerce Layer scope format issue - prioritize market.scope over market.id\n- Remove case conversion in commerceLayerApi.ts to preserve market ID case sensitivity\n- Add domain parameter to Commerce Layer config for proper authentication\n- Implement market persistence with Zustand persist middleware\n\nMarket Switching Implementation:\n- Update MarketSwitcher to use global market store directly\n- Remove prop drilling for market state throughout component tree\n- Add localStorage persistence for market selection across browser sessions\n- Update SimpleHeader and AppProvider to use global market state\n\nCommerce Layer Integration:\n- Fix 400 Bad Request authentication errors for EU market\n- Ensure proper scope format (market:id:xxx) is sent to Commerce Layer\n- Add comprehensive logging for debugging market switching\n- Implement price component refresh logic for market changes\n\nCode Cleanup:\n- Remove unused props from SimpleHeader and MarketSwitcher components\n- Simplify AppProvider by removing local market management\n- Update market-store.ts with proper TypeScript types and persistence\n- Add proper error handling and debugging throughout\n\nThe market switching now works correctly with proper Commerce Layer authentication\nand price updates for both UK and EU markets with persistent user preferences.","tree":{"sha":"14af4f81d375baea47e466ce319e7a89cdda93a1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/trees/14af4f81d375baea47e466ce319e7a89cdda93a1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/commits/dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d","node_id":"C_kwDOOpaKl9oAKGRjNmFjNzRmOWY2YTA0YjM5Yjk1NDBiMGI2MTZjZGNlYzE1MjQ0OWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git/seth-haus/commit/4d0348241d9ac7511ad8c519a1d5bfe7513df303","sha":"4d0348241d9ac7511ad8c519a1d5bfe7513df303","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/4d0348241d9ac7511ad8c519a1d5bfe7513df303"}],"sha":"dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/dc6ac74f9f6a04b39b9540b0b616cdcec152449d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/commits/4d0348241d9ac7511ad8c519a1d5bfe7513df303/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-24T22:21:14Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-24T22:21:14Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"message":"Implement Commerce Layer cart integration and improve UI layout\n\nMajor Features:\n- Add Commerce Layer Drop-in.js v2 mini-cart with hosted cart integration\n- Implement working add-to-cart functionality on product detail pages\n- Add cart count display and real-time updates in header\n\nUI/UX Improvements:\n- Fix header content alignment to match main content margins\n- Implement proper three-section header layout (left logo, center nav, right controls)\n- Add global page container CSS classes for consistent layout\n- Reduce add-to-cart button height and improve proportions\n- Add fun ''Buy Now'' button with humorous demo messages\n- Remove debug UI elements for clean production appearance\n\nTechnical Updates:\n- Add Commerce Layer mini-cart CSS and component type declarations\n- Update favicon paths to use migrated-assets directory\n- Enhance Commerce Layer configuration with defaultAttributes\n- Add proper error handling and loading states for cart functionality\n- Implement responsive container classes with max-width constraints\n\nFiles Modified:\n- SimpleHeader.tsx: Cart integration and layout alignment\n- ProductDetailPage.tsx: Add-to-cart functionality and UI improvements\n- index.css: Global container classes and Commerce Layer styles\n- index.html: Mini-cart CSS and favicon updates\n- App.tsx: Enhanced Commerce Layer configuration\n- commerce-layer-drop-in.d.ts: Additional component type declarations\n\nThe site now has a fully functional e-commerce cart experience with proper layout alignment.","tree":{"sha":"491921760e20fda01d035e54fe445b726c107968","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/trees/491921760e20fda01d035e54fe445b726c107968"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/commits/4d0348241d9ac7511ad8c519a1d5bfe7513df303","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/follow