nt_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-23T08:09:52Z","email":"binder@gmail.com","name":"Seth Bindernagel"},"message":"feat: Refactor and optimize product listing functions\n\n- Renamed `netlify/functions/src/featured-direct.js` to `netlify/functions/src/product-listing.ts`\n- Migrated `product-listing.ts` to TypeScript.\n- Updated frontend (`ui/src/utils/product-store.ts`) to call the new `product-listing` function via `commerceLayerApi.getProductsListing()`, correcting a previous misdirection.\n- Deleted unused/legacy Netlify functions:\n    - `netlify/functions/src/featured-products-handler.js`\n    - `netlify/functions/src/featured-products-simple.js`\n    - `netlify/functions/src/index.ts` (and removed implicit `test.js` reference)\n- Ensured `netlify/functions/src/featured-products.ts` remains untouched, as it serves the homepage featured products.\n\nThis commit significantly cleans up the Netlify functions directory and ensures correct API calls for the product listing page.","tree":{"sha":"e259e397a3e043064c2e7c343407c4fd7639739e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/trees/e259e397a3e043064c2e7c343407c4fd7639739e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/binder-git/seth-haus/git/commits/282c2d13712d150e485e58dc49957ea7697e5b4f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/957682?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/binder-git","id":957682,"login":"binder-git","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk1NzY4Mg==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/binder-git/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/b