comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-16T05:33:49Z","email":"amedeo.pelliccia@gmail.com","name":"Amedeo Pelliccia''s"},"message":"Enhance fuel efficiency optimization\n\nAdd `opt_fuel` package for optimizing fuel efficiency.\n\n* **Core Functionality**\n  - Move `optimize_fuel_efficiency` function to `opt_fuel/core.py` with added docstring.\n  - Implement `classical_baseline_cost` function in `classical_baseline_cost.py`.\n\n* **Unit Handling**\n  - Set up `pint` for unit handling in `opt_fuel/units.py` with Quantity wrappers.\n  - Add unit tests for unit handling in `opt_fuel/tests/test_units.py`.\n\n* **Exception Handling**\n  - Define `InvalidPhysicalParameterError` in `opt_fuel/exceptions.py`.\n\n* **Testing**\n  - Write unit tests for `optimize_fuel_efficiency` in `opt_fuel/tests/test_core.py` using `pytest` and `hypothesis`.\n\n* **Packaging and CI**\n  - Add packaging metadata in `opt_fuel/pyproject.toml`.\n  - Provide an overview and usage instructions in `opt_fuel/README.md`.\n  - Set up CI workflow in `opt_fuel/.github/workflows/ci.yml`.\n\n* **C Implementation**\n  - Implement `optimize_fuel_efficiency` function in C in `optimize_fuel_efficiency.c`.\n\n* **Cleanup**\n  - Delete `efficiency.py`.\n\n---\n\nFor more details, open the [Copilot Workspace session](https://copilot-workspace.githubnext.com/Gaia-Q-Space/.github?shareId=XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX).","tree":{"sha":"ed0505e377ffda99cd55bc02b0fb781a4cfd8c96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaia-Q-Space/.github/git/trees/ed0505e377ffda99cd55bc02b0fb781a4cfd8c96"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaia-Q-Space/.github/git/commits/e231257a050fb9dc134c33a7a84cf2ada12d3b58","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164860269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/foll