"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AmedeoPelliccia","id":164860269,"login":"AmedeoPelliccia","node_id":"U_kgDOCdORbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaia-Q-Space/.github/commits/1b77b20abda1f82620dc7aaaec42474134c3138c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-05-15T00:12:26Z","email":"amedeo.pelliccia@gmail.com","name":"Amedeo Pelliccia''s"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-05-15T00:12:26Z","email":"amedeo.pelliccia@gmail.com","name":"Amedeo Pelliccia''s"},"message":"Add GAIA-QAO Space Systems Product Catalog\n\nAdd detailed introduction to the GAIA-QAO Space Systems Product Catalog in `README.md`.\n\n- **Introduction and Identification Structure**:\n  - Add a detailed introduction to the GAIA-QAO Space Systems Product Catalog.\n  - Include the identification structure for GAIA-QAO Object Identification System (GQOIS).\n\n- **Satellite (SAT) Models**:\n  - Add a table for Satellite (SAT) Models with sub-types, model codes, model names, descriptions, key quantum enhancements & specs, and GAIA-QAO ID examples & notes.\n\n- **Orbital Platform/Vehicle (ORB) Models**:\n  - Add a table for Orbital Platform/Vehicle (ORB) Models with sub-types, model codes, model names, descriptions, key quantum enhancements & specs, and GAIA-QAO ID examples & notes.\n\n- **Launch System (LCH) Models**:\n  - Add a table for Launch System (LCH) Models with sub-types, model codes, model names, descriptions, key quantum enhancements & specs, and GAIA-QAO ID examples & notes.\n\n- **Probe (PRB) Models**:\n  - Add a table for Probe (PRB) Models with sub-types, model codes, model names, descriptions, key quantum enhancements & specs, and GAIA-QAO ID examples & notes.\n\n- **Space Systems Classification**:\n  - Include a section for Space Systems Classification and Additional Classification Systems.\n\n- **Certification Roadmap and Investor Value Proposition**:\n  - Add a Certification Roadmap section.\n  - Add an Investor Value Proposition section.\n\n---\n\nFor more details, open the [Copilot Workspace session](https://copilot-workspace.githubnext.com/Gaia-Q-Space/.github?shareId=XXXX-XXXX-XXXX-XXXX).","tree":{"sha":"930999dddd9d3a417cc0fdd8a0ee84ea4056d167","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaia-Q-Space/.github/git/trees/930999dddd9d3a417cc0fdd8a0ee84ea4056d167"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Gaia-Q-Space/.github/git/commits/1b77b20abda1f82620dc7aaaec42474134c3138c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/164860269?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AmedeoPelliccia","id":164860269,"login":"AmedeoPelliccia","node_id":"U_kgDOCdORbQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AmedeoPelliccia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Amed