rwinboersma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T20:59:56Z","email":"dboersma@tetrascience.com","name":"darwinboersma"},"message":"chore: SW-2322 address review comments on the telemetry bindings\n\n- disabled-no-egress: restore navigator.sendBeacon. jsdom does not implement\n  it, so it has to be assigned rather than spied — and neither\n  unstubAllGlobals (stubGlobal only) nor restoreAllMocks (spies only) undoes\n  an assignment, so the mock leaked into every later suite in the file''s\n  worker. Captures the original and puts it back.\n- global-handlers: record the SSR no-op in the installed WeakMap, so the\n  documented once-per-client contract holds in non-browser runtimes too.\n  Previously each call there returned a different uninstall function.\n- telemetry-provider: one import from @tetrascience-npm/request/telemetry\n  instead of a value import plus a type-only import, with inline type\n  markers.\n\nTypecheck, lint and the telemetry suites (84 tests) pass. The 12 RightPanel\nfailures in the full unit run are pre-existing and reproduce identically on\nmain.","tree":{"sha":"d8a3b4ca2ab624ec8e5b8d1906b164fcf5f08a3e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/trees/d8a3b4ca2ab624ec8e5b8d1906b164fcf5f08a3e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/commits/eb5ea963a6948eb8efe4d817d296ac2f9f00c4d0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254488726?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darwinboersma","id":254488726,"login":"darwinboersma","node_id":"U_kgDO