wers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darwinboersma","id":254488726,"login":"darwinboersma","node_id":"U_kgDODyswlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/commits/0df301dd433cb29580a5e1c87c510b8de8cfb6ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T17:01:41Z","email":"dboersma@tetrascience.com","name":"darwinboersma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T17:01:41Z","email":"dboersma@tetrascience.com","name":"darwinboersma"},"message":"chore: SW-2322 resolve @tetrascience-npm deps from public npm\n\nrequest 0.4.0 (with ./telemetry) and ts-connectors-sdk 3.2.0 are both on\npublic npm now, so the branch-local JFrog scope exception is unnecessary.\nRemoving it drops the JFROG_ARTIFACTORY_READ_NPM_AUTH requirement that the\nVercel Storybook project does not have, and lets checksumBehavior go back to\nverifying instead of ignoring.\n\nThe two scoped checksums were recorded against JFrog''s byte-different\narchives; re-recorded against public npm, which restores the exact values\nmain already has. Verified with a cold, credential-free ''yarn install\n--immutable'' plus build-storybook, build, typecheck, typecheck:e2e and lint.\nNo dependency version changes.","tree":{"sha":"f9bd3ce674d97e4a4d16d50b7967d692af0c6e67","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/trees/f9bd3ce674d97e4a4d16d50b7967d692af0c6e67"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/commits/0df301dd433cb29580a5e1c87c510b8de8cfb6ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254488726?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darwinboersma","id":254488726,"login":"darwinboersma","node_id":"U_kgDODyswlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/commit/0df301dd433cb29580a5e1c87c510b8de8cfb6ac","node_id":"C_kwDOOqjWQNoAKDBkZjMwMWRkNDMzY2IyOTU4MGE1ZTFjODdjNTEwYjhkZThjZmI2YWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/commit/af2b857eefdac874a44026306ea4b1b7caf254fd","sha":"af2b857eefdac874a44026306ea4b1b7caf254fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/commits/af2b857eefdac874a44026306ea4b1b7caf254fd"}],"sha":"0df301dd433cb29580a5e1c87c510b8de8cfb6ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/commits/0df301dd433cb29580a5e1c87c510b8de8cfb6ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254488726?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darwinboersma","id":254488726,"login":"darwinboersma","node_id":"U_kgDODyswlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/commits/af2b857eefdac874a44026306ea4b1b7caf254fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:49:04Z","email":"dboersma@tetrascience.com","name":"darwinboersma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-04T12:49:04Z","email":"dboersma@tetrascience.com","name":"darwinboersma"},"message":"chore: ignore every .env, and ship the template the suite tells you to copy\n\nAddresses @owilliams-tetrascience''s review on #193: \"can we exclude any type of\n.env file in git ignore?\"\n\nYes, and broader than asked. The old entry named one path\n(`test/e2e/.env.e2e`), so it protected exactly the file someone had already\nthought about. `.env*` protects the ones nobody has thought about yet — the next\ntool that picks `.env.local`, `.env.test`, or an app''s `.env.production`.\n\n`.env*` rather than `.env`: secrets live in the SUFFIXED variants, which a bare\n`.env` entry does not match at all.\n\nThe negation had to be matched by SUFFIX, not exact name. My first attempt\ncarved out `!.env.example`, and verifying it against real paths caught that this\ndoes NOT match `test/e2e/.env.e2e.example` — the file `env.ts` actually tells\nyou to copy. It would have been silently ignored. `!*.example` / `!*.sample` /\n`!*.template` is as broad as the rule it is carving out of.\n\nVerified against real paths rather than by reading the pattern:\n\n  test/e2e/.env.e2e          IGNORED\n  .env                       IGNORED\n  .env.local                 IGNORED\n  apps/y/.env.production     IGNORED\n  test/e2e/.env.e2e.example  COMMITTABLE\n  .env.example               COMMITTABLE\n\nThat check also turned up a real gap: `.env.e2e.example` was never committed, so\n`env.ts`''s error message (\"Copy test/e2e/.env.e2e.example and fill it in\")\npointed at a file that does not exist. Added it, derived from what `env.ts`\nactually reads — all 11 variables, marked required/optional/auth-exclusive to\nmatch the validation, with the artifact identity documented as overridable.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c121557220eb32113ac0961d0e8f4d9c81c3a551","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/trees/c121557220eb32113ac0961d0e8f4d9c81c3a551"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/commits/af2b857eefdac874a44026306ea4b1b7caf254fd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254488726?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darwinboersma","id":254488726,"login":"darwinboersma","node_id":"U_kgDODyswlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma