","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/commits/510fb0fde662a1856d32ef2ad7410687f3b7c98a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-03T21:54:45Z","email":"dboersma@tetrascience.com","name":"darwinboersma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-03T21:54:45Z","email":"dboersma@tetrascience.com","name":"darwinboersma"},"message":"fix: SW-2352 export HeaderDict + TODO to drop ts-token-ref resolution\n\nReview follow-up: export the HeaderDict type from the public ./server and\n./server/auth entry points (owilliams) — it now backs ExpressRequestLike.headers,\nso consumers building a typed headers object shouldn''t have to reach into internal\npaths. Also add a next-major TODO to drop the ts-token-ref -> connector-KV\nresolution (blee): the proxy now injects the JWT via the ts-auth-token header and\nno longer forwards the ref cookie, so that path is dead in production.","tree":{"sha":"8aa0f79fd679958ad5e937ebe8cf81b974bca9af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/trees/8aa0f79fd679958ad5e937ebe8cf81b974bca9af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/tetrascience/ts-lib-ui-kit/git/commits/510fb0fde662a1856d32ef2ad7410687f3b7c98a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/254488726?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/darwinboersma","id":254488726,"login":"darwinboersma","node_id":"U_kgDODyswlg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/darwinboersma/receive